        en: { name: 'Grey Glacier', description: 'A glacier of the Southern Patagonian Ice Field that ends in a grey lake in a three-kilometre wall of blue ice. Icebergs broken from its edge lie along the shore.', tip: 'Take the boat from Hotel Lago Grey right up to the ice wall, and walk along the beach to the icebergs on the point.' },
